# Learning Python

This repository documents my journey as I learn Python. Each project file will
have a related `learned` text file describing what I learned and why.

## Progress labels

- **Not yet** — Something I have not been able to do or understand yet.
- **Yet** — Something that still needs to be done.
- **No label** — Something I have completed.

## Why I’m doing this

This project is a record of what I have learned, what I am still working on,
and how I got there. It also supports my goal of building my
EasilyUncomplicated app or web app idea.

I’ll share parts of the journey on
[YouTube](https://youtube.com/@easilyuncomplicated).
